  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Welcome to \"AmorSea,\" a luxurious 4-bedroom + bunk room, 4-bathroom haven nestled in Eagle's Landing on 30A. Just a 5-minute walk from Inlet Beach, this stunning home offers the ultimate coastal escape, blending high-end comfort with laid-back beach vibes. Relax to the sound of the waves from your private outdoor oasis, complete with a temperature-controlled swim-spa, cozy fire pit, and multiple lounging areas.<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>AmorSea's prime location puts you steps away from local dining and shopping at The Crossings at Inlet Beach, as well as the famous \"Donut Hole\" restaurant. Explore nearby communities like Rosemary Beach and Seacrest Beach. Enjoy nightly entertainment, sweet treats, and local flavors just a short ride away. <br><br><br><br>BEACH ACCESS:<br><br>Take a short 5-minute walk to Inlet Beach Access, where the emerald waters and sugar-white sands await.<br><br><br><br>ACCOMMODATIONS:<br><br>This home comfortably sleeps 16 guests across five sleeping areas:<br><br><br><br>First Floor:<br><br>-Bedroom 1: Queen Bed with access to a hallway bath<br><br><br><br>Second Floor:<br><br>-Bedroom 2: King Bed with en-suite bathroom<br><br>-Bedroom 3: Queen, shared bathroom<br><br>-Bedroom 4: King Bed, shared bathroom<br><br>Third Floor:<br><br>-Bunkroom: 2 twin over queen bunk beds and a sofa bed, full bathroom<br><br><br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br><br>- 4 Bikes<br><br>-Private Swim Spa<br><br>-Cozy Fire Pit: Perfect for evening gatherings<br><br>-Gas Grill: Propane provided for your BBQ needs<br><br>-Multiple Balconies: Enjoy the views from every floor<br><br>-Smart TVs: Stay entertained with streaming services<br><br>-Coffee Maker: Choose between pods or drip for your morning brew<br><br>-Washer/Dryer: Convenient laundry access<br><br>-Self-Check-In: Hassle-free arrival<br><br>-Full Linen Package: Includes bedding, bath towels, washcloths, and more<br><br>-Fully Stocked Kitchen: Equipped with all the essentials for meal prep<br><br>-Indoor fireplace is not for use<br><br><br><br>Private Heated Spa – $50/night <br><br>Take a dip in your private pool, perfect for any season! <br><br>-Must be booked for the full stay (no partial payments)<br><br>-Temperature is pre-set for optimal comfort<br><br><br><br>PARKING:<br><br>This property includes 4 parking spaces for your convenience.<br><br><br><br>Book Your Stay!<br><br>Unlock a memorable and stress-free vacation by reserving your spot at our enchanting property. Experience the allure of AmorSea, a 4-bedroom + bunk room haven located on Highway 30A. With 4 bathrooms, parking for up to 4 vehicles. Comfortably accommodating up to 16 guests, it's the perfect setting for your getaway. Feel free to reach out with any questions or special requests. <br><br><br><br>Your escape to 30A awaits - secure your dates today!<br><br><br><br>ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:<br><br>- Must be 25 years old to book and stay at the property during entire reservation period<br><br>- No pets<br><br>- Just a quick heads-up: once you book we'll be using our nifty guest messaging platform for all our chit-chats, so keep an eye on your text for messages from our 850 phone number. Additionally, before the fun begins, we'll need you to sign our rental agreement that has a $100 authorization hold for incidentals. It's all part of the check-in charm! Thanks for being awesome!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
